WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.820
This one is about command lines.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.937
Your colleague needs your tool.

3
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.212
But they will never open a terminal,
or remember the options.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.119
Here, the command builds its own page.

5
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.080
Every option becomes a field.
Every choice becomes a list.

6
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.150
Your colleague fills it in,
and gets the exact command back.

7
00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:45.000
The secret: it reads the tool's
own definition, not its help text.

8
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.350
So the form can never show
an option the tool does not have.

9
00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.519
The page is a single file.
Nothing to install, nothing to host.

10
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.080
It never runs anything.
It only writes the command.

11
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

12
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
